{"ref":"BDB, פְּרוּדָא","hw":"פְּרוּדָא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרוּדָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> post-exil. name <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:55\" href=\"/Ezra.2.55\">Ezr 2:55</a> (Φαδουρα), = <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרִידָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:56\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.56\">Ne 7:57</a> (Φερειδα; 𝔊L as Ezr).","next":"BDB, פרד","prev":"BDB, פְּרֻדָה"}